{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 1, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 13792991872139668614, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "retries 503 with bounded attempts; no retry on other errors\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"README.md": {"bytes": 96, "mtime": 1792286047.5221384, "sha256": "4b6141730d2c1b7fdbc977c1575d67ebdcde4f155ea0f8014444615df7e2d1cb"}, "weather.py": {"bytes": 932, "mtime": 1792467567.9906273, "sha256": "f73dee3bc743d4d8fcfab0e3ee38f61732ef894980d4138bdc8132350708b2b7"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/bdfc21df43f93c8cc10bf67fe87cc0c53f5f7a8b/omp", "-p", "Add retry with backoff (3 attempts) to `WeatherClient.get` when the server returns 503.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step7-opus-1019-S7C/omp-30/transcripts/without/trig-omp-netclient/5/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 1, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "infra", "failure_reason": "Anthropic stream stalled while waiting for the next event", "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step7-opus-1019-S7C/omp-30/cells/without/trig-omp-netclient/5/workspace", "first_after_build": false, "first_side": "without", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/16.2.8 (/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/bdfc21df43f93c8cc10bf67fe87cc0c53f5f7a8b/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Now verify against a real local server.\n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries when the server returns 503. It makes 3 attempts in total and waits longer before each retry.\n\n- **When it retries:** only on an `HTTPError` with code 503. Any other status code, or any other kind of error, is raised right away as before.\n- **Waits:** `backoff * 2**(attempt-1)`, so with the default `backoff=0.5` that's 0.5s after the first 503 and 1s after the second.\n- **After the last attempt:** if the third attempt also gets a 503, that 503 `HTTPError` is raised to the caller.\n- **Settings:** two new constructor arguments, `max_attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5`. Existing calls work without changes.\n\nI tested it against a real local HTTP server with `backoff=0.05`:\n\n| Server responses | Result | Requests made |\n|---|---|---|\n| 503, 503, 200 | JSON returned | 3 |\n| 503, 503, 503 | 503 `HTTPError` raised | 3 |\n| 500 | 500 `HTTPError` raised | 1 |\n| 200 | JSON returned | 1 |\n\nThe client ignores any `Retry-After` header the server sends, and timeouts and connection errors are not retried. I didn't add a test file because the repo has no test setup.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "provider_error": "Anthropic stream stalled while waiting for the next event", "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": 2, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 34796, "requests_cache_write": 178053, "requests_cost_usd": 0.9344201999999999, "requests_count": 6, "requests_input_uncached": 14, "requests_output": 1857, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial5", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 68, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-20T03:39:16.368568+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 147.775, "t_checker_s": 1.938, "t_env_setup_s": 0.0, "task": "trig-omp-n